  "notes": "Distinctive details: KPI tiles have pastel tinted header bands (pink/mint/peach/grey) matching the semantic color of the big amount; amounts split into small grey '$', large bold integer, small grey cents. Expense cards carry a colored category ribbon tab on the top-left edge (purple Activities, orange Food & drink, blue Transport, green Accommodation, sky Flights, grey Other) and a matching pastel icon tile. Travelers are encoded as colored single-letter avatar dots (Y purple, J pink, P green, T orange) reused in split chips, settle-up arrows and balances. Edit/delete icons sit in a detached rounded column beside each card. 'you borrowed' (red) / 'you lent' (green) pills under amounts. Date group headers in small uppercase with count pill and right-aligned 'spent' total pill. Dark near-black (#111827) is the primary button/active-tab color. The page scrolls inside an inner panel."
